+## 2,501-Kanji Mind Tree, Dictionary & Stroke System
+### Architecture baseline, provenance remediation, security contract, and implementation roadmap
+
+**Audit date:** 2026-11-02 (UTC)  
+**Repository:** `ranimony-afk/nihingobridgeupgrade`  
+**Scope:** read-only repository/gate inspection plus the narrow first-party provenance correction described in §4. No 2,501-character generation, database connection, migration, provisioning, import, deployment, commit, push, or PR operation was performed.
