+
+## Decision by family
+
+- **Best narrow use candidates:** existing KanjiVG geometry; a separately reviewed, CC BY-SA 4.0 OpenJLPT grammar seed; Japanese WordNet v1.1 semantic data; official Unicode UCD/Unihan after obtaining the unicode.org package and its notice.
+- **Hold under historical/source gates:** KANJIDIC2, JMdict and Tatoeba. KANJIDIC2 has positive but incompletely retained license evidence; JMdict remains UNKNOWN; Tatoeba's current official terms conflict and its exact dataset version is unresolved.
+- **Do not use as a substitute source:** `jmdict-simplified` (packaging only), Japanese Language Data aggregate (upstream mix), Waller mappings (community classification, not official JLPT), or Unicode Tools development data for production.
+- **No adequate source established:** idioms, collocations, Tamil translations and source-attributed pedagogical/Mind Tree relations. Commission original work under written terms or conduct separately authorized source research.
+
+The complete source-level operation matrix and field families are in `PHASE-K0.13-FIELD-AUTHORIZATION-MATRIX.json`. Every candidate remains blocked from NihongoBridge staging and canonical use regardless of the source-level license status.
