+# K0.13 Integration Dependency and Isolation Report
+
+## Decision
+
+**No source integration is safe in this turn.** K0.13 therefore created only new research/gate deliverables. No application, schema, seed, test, migration, canonical data, CMS, database, deployment or build configuration was changed.
+
+This is not a claim that integration is technically impossible in principle. It is blocked now by (1) no trustworthy clean base for the existing K0.4A–K0.12 work, (2) unresolved source/owner gates, (3) no field-level provenance enforcement in the schema, and (4) unavailable dependencies/environment checks.
+
+## Repository and isolation boundary
+
+- Active branch: `arena/e77540e3-nihingobridgeupgrade`.
+- At start of K0.13, `HEAD` and `origin/main` were `d3e4dfc2edf3852cd05a07acff711bd5e365b1fe`; the checkout is shallow/grafted. The remote branch query returned only `origin/main`; no ahead commits were visible. This does not establish complete remote history.
+- K0.4A–K0.11 artifacts are worktree-only and not present at `HEAD`. K0.12 records the same isolation finding and explicitly forbids copying worktree artifacts into a fabricated clean base.
+- The checkout was already dirty before K0.13. The exact pre-existing status entries were captured and preserved. New K0.13 deliverables are additive untracked files; no existing path was overwritten.
+- No trusted Windows checkout was available. Arena and Windows are separate; no Windows path/state is inferred.
+
+### K0.12's recorded worktree-only prerequisites
+
+K0.12 records these phase groups as present in the worktree but absent at `HEAD`:
+
+- **K0.4A:** `reports/gates/PHASE-K0.4A-2501-KANJI-AUTHORITY-RIGHTS-OWNER-PACKET.md`, `reports/gates/PHASE-K0.4A-2501-KANJI-SOURCE-LOCK.json`.
+- **K0.5A:** `reports/gates/PHASE-K0.5A-RIGHTS-AWARE-ARCHITECTURE.md`, `src/services/knowledge/provenance/rightsPolicy.ts`, `src/services/knowledge/editorial/fieldProvenance.ts`, `src/services/knowledge/editorial/mindTreeEvidenceGraph.ts`.
+- **K0.5B:** `reports/gates/PHASE-K0.5B-RIGHTS-POLICY-ENFORCEMENT-COMPLETION.md`, `src/services/knowledge/provenance/rightsEnforcement.ts`, `src/services/knowledge/provenance/rightsAwareExport.ts`.
+- **K0.6–K0.9:** owner decisions, read-path/membership logic and foundation workflow artifacts are worktree-only as enumerated in `PHASE-K0.12-SOURCE-EVIDENCE-REGISTER.json`.
+- **K0.10:** candidate-path decisions, verification report, foundation builder and its tests are worktree-only.
+- **K0.11:** `reports/gates/PHASE-K0.11-SOURCE-AUTHORIZATION-READINESS.json`, its report, `scripts/verify-k011-readiness.py` and its tests are worktree-only.
