+# K0.14 Integration Report
+
+**Application/database integration: none.** K0.14 stayed independent of the application's runtime, canonical loaders, database and CMS. This was deliberate: repository preflight showed a heavily modified, mixed worktree with no established clean integration base, and existing rights/source gates do not authorize canonical ingestion.
+
+## Existing integration surface inspected
+
+- `src/db/schema.ts`: grammar storage is split across the existing grammar pattern/example model; `kanji_composition` is a compact generic composition table. No K0.14-compatible per-field lineage/correction/review lifecycle or full Mind Tree evidence taxonomy was established.
