+- Source identity: `upstream:kanjidic2:2023-08`, official XML header `2023-08-20`, database version `2023-232`, file version `4`.
+- Immutable archive: `Jitendex/edrdg-dictionary-archive@9cb709b87f43c7bceb494eefbe7f8b8f42744502`, path `kanjidic2_xml/kanjidic2.xml.br`.
