+The companion `decisionLedger` must include candidate identities not selected and reason codes (`not_in_policy_source`, `lower_precedence_at_cutoff`, `source_conflict`, `identity_unresolved`, `license_blocked`, `deferred_owner_decision`, `duplicate_same_scalar`, `outside_target_preserved`, etc.). It also contains all excluded/deferred/quarantined evidence and a count reconciliation. Hash and version it with the manifest so reproducibility does not hide removed candidates.
