+- **J — learner/legacy JLPT proxy:** any old `<jlpt>` value 1–4. Not a current official level list.
+- **N — name-related proxy:** KANJIDIC2 `<grade>` 9 or 10. Not an official Jinmeiyō list. `<nanori>` is separately counted as a source field, not as name-list membership.
